    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the 400-600mg range sounds more like what i need tho cuz the cramps are pretty intense. since my kidney stuff is only stage 2 and not really severe yet, is it okay if i just go a bit higher, like maybe 1000mg? i dont want to wait weeks for a doctor appointment just to get some sleep.",
