      "content": "While 1000mg may provide faster relief, be cautious as high doses can be toxic, and your kidneys may not be able to process it efficiently. Consider a gradual increase to 500mg or 750mg first to assess your body's response, and then reassess with your doctor to avoid potential kidney strain. Additionally, consult with a healthcare professional before exceeding the recommended dose, especially with existing kidney issues.",
