      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I strongly advise against exceeding 500mg initially. However, if you still want to explore, signs of high magnesium levels (hypermagnesemia) can include confusion, dizziness, nausea, vomiting, weakness, fatigue, and muscle weakness. If you experience any of these symptoms, especially severe ones, seek medical attention immediately. Also, be aware that it may interfere with your kidney function if you have existing kidney issues.",
